{"unit_id": "Dogtiti__dsh-predict#card-card-zh", "repo": "Dogtiti/dsh-predict", "commit": "3168fdd8b74288a11b1a0e644647197ab657da34", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-predict（DSH Web 插件）：根据当前会话的对话尾部生成下一条可能的用户指令，并显示在输入框占位位置。它在 Host 注册预测接口，在 Client 的 composer 插槽绘制建议；用户可按 Tab 或点击将建议填为可编辑草稿，不会自动发送。占位文字无法重绘时会回退到输入框下方的提示行。适合希望快速继续编码任务的 DSH 用户；模型默认跟随当前会话，也可配置 provider 和 model。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:45-72", "client.js:337-350", "client.js:274-335"]}
{"unit_id": "Dogtiti__dsh-predict#card-card-en", "repo": "Dogtiti/dsh-predict", "commit": "3168fdd8b74288a11b1a0e644647197ab657da34", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-predict predicts a likely next instruction from the conversation and shows it in the DSH composer. Press Tab or click to add it as an editable draft. If the placeholder cannot be repainted, a row appears below it. The model follows the current session unless configured otherwise.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:45-72", "client.js:337-350", "client.js:274-335"]}
