{"unit_id": "Dogtiti__dsh-predict#feature-feature-1", "repo": "Dogtiti/dsh-predict", "commit": "3168fdd8b74288a11b1a0e644647197ab657da34", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-predict 的功能「预测下一条指令」：读取会话消息尾部并交给当前会话使用的模型生成建议。会话有新活动时重新请求，同一会话序号下可复用短期缓存。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:144-164", "index.js:248-303"]}
